      "source": [
        "from __future__ import annotations\n",
        "\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "import sys\n",
        "\n",
        "REPO = Path.cwd()\n",
        "if not (REPO / \"research\" / \"tick_window_viz\").is_dir():\n",
        "    REPO = Path(\"/Users/mishatrubik/Desktop/spread\")\n",
        "if str(REPO) not in sys.path:\n",
        "    sys.path.insert(0, str(REPO))\n",
        "\n",
        "from research.tick_window_viz import load_tick_window\n",
        "\n",
        "df, meta = load_tick_window(\n",
        "    COIN,\n",
        "    WINDOW_START,\n",
        "    minutes=WINDOW_MINUTES,\n",
        "    source=SOURCE,\n",
        "    ticks_root=TICKS_ROOT,\n",
        "    vps_host=VPS_HOST,\n",
        "    remote_roots=REMOTE_ROOTS,\n",
        "    apply_fail_closed=APPLY_FAIL_CLOSED,\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"coin\", meta[\"coin\"])\n",
        "print(\"window\", meta[\"window_start_utc\"], \"→\", meta[\"window_end_utc\"], \"UTC (end exclusive)\")\n",
        "print(\"aligned_5m\", meta[\"aligned_5m\"], \"source\", meta[\"source\"])\n",
        "print(\"files\", meta[\"files\"] or meta[\"expected_compacted\"])\n",
        "print(\"rows raw/plot\", meta[\"n_raw\"], meta[\"n_plot\"], \"fail-closed drop\", meta[\"n_fail_closed_drop\"])\n",
        "if df.empty:\n",
        "    print(\"нет тиков в окне — дыра или монета отсутствует в этом файле\")\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    show = [\n",
        "        c\n",
        "        for c in (\n",
        "            \"event_dt\",\n",
        "            \"trigger\",\n",
        "            \"spread_long\",\n",
        "            \"spread_short\",\n",
        "            \"okx_bid_price\",\n",
        "            \"okx_ask_price\",\n",
        "            \"bybit_bid_price\",\n",
        "            \"bybit_ask_price\",\n",
        "            \"okx_latency_ms\",\n",
        "            \"bybit_latency_ms\",\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        if c in df.columns\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "    print(df[show].head(3))\n",
        "    print(\"…\")\n",
        "    print(df[show].tail(3))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "plot-md",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 3. График (Plotly)\n",
        "\n",
        "Пять панелей, общая ось X UTC, крупный размер (~1500×1750):\n",
        "\n",
        "1. `spread_long` + `spread_short`\n",
        "2. OKX bid\n",
        "3. OKX ask\n",
        "4. Bybit bid\n",
        "5. Bybit ask\n",
        "\n",
        "Линия рвётся, если соседние тики дальше `GAP_BREAK_MS` (дыры не интерполируются). Наведение на bid/ask: venue, side, price, `delay_ms`, exchange_ts, local_recv_ts, `trigger`.\n",
        "\n",
        "На одном 5-минутном баре много тиков — это нормально. SMA сюда не рисуем: в gear 2.2 SMA — одно значение на close 5-минутной свечи, не rolling по тикам."
      ]
    },
